+/// rapsodo-golf-on-mac: how long the RX injector sleeps once rx_ring_ has stayed
+/// empty through its spin. Upstream yields instead, but on macOS sched_yield()
+/// returns at once when nothing else wants the core, so the thread sat at ~100%
+/// of a core with no traffic. Frames that arrive meanwhile wait in rx_ring_
+/// (2048 slots) and go out as one batch: <= ~0.6 ms extra latency, <1% CPU idle.
+constexpr auto kRxIdleSleep = std::chrono::microseconds(500);
